@startuml
title US-021 - Upload learning material
actor "Tutor / Student" as User
participant "Upload controller" as API
participant "Upload handler" as Handler
database "SQL Server" as DB
participant "File validator" as Validator
participant "Local file storage" as Storage

User -> API: POST multipart (title, file, TA, optional lesson)
API -> API: Authenticate and authorize role
API -> Handler: Upload command with authenticated account
Handler -> DB: Check TA participant and lesson/TA match
alt Context missing or inaccessible
  Handler --> API: ContextNotFound
  API --> User: 404
else Context allowed
  Handler -> Validator: Validate length, name, format, signature
  Validator --> Handler: Normalized file metadata
  Handler -> Storage: Save under generated key
  Storage --> Handler: Storage key
  Handler -> DB: Save Draft material, uploader and context
  alt Save succeeds
    DB --> Handler: Saved
    Handler --> API: Material metadata
    API --> User: 201 Created
  else Save fails or request is cancelled
    Handler -> Storage: Delete file (uncancelled token)
    Handler --> API: UploadFailed / cancellation
    API --> User: Failure response
  end
end
note over Storage
Failed file copies delete their partial output.
Cleanup failures are logged for investigation.
end note
@enduml
